  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2f78a0a3e840c3b488304b0ff928238c, type: 3}
  m_Name: BoxerLoreSO
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  LoreTitle: Boxer
  Lore: "I. \u201CWorth is determined by victory\u2026\u201D\n\r\n\tOne, two, punch.
    One, two, punch. Knockout! Boxer\u2019s life was defined by hard work and victory.
    Born to a city of metal, she dedicated her life to fighting. School was always
    a struggle and her creative endeavors never got far. However, she took pride
    in being able to rip through anyone that stood in her way.\r\n\r\nWhen she first
    joined the arena, she was greatly underestimated. A girl of her stature and weight
    surely stood no chance against some of their greater champions. Yet, her punch
    was stronger than her appearance revealed. She became famous for her winning
    move\u2014a grand slam that sent anyone in her way flying across the ring.\r\n\r\nFrom
    the first time she showed her face at the arena, a string of victories followed
    along. \r\n\r\nBoxer's winning streak\r\n\r#\nII. \u201CThe bitter taste of defeat
    is a flavor I\u2019d rather forget\u2026\u201D\r\n\n\nDevastating loss\n\r\n\r#\nIII.
    \u201CAppetite is the desire to be stronger\u2026\u201D\r\n\t\n\nModifications\r\n\r#\n\n\nIV.
    \u201C?\u201D\r\n\t\n\nWinning streak; devastating loss\n\n\r\n\r#\nV.  \u201CCan
    a life be won?\u201D\r\n\r\n\r\nSickening, sickening, sickening.\r\nambition
    was not a word that could be used to describe the boxer. thirsty, hungry, insatiable.
    \r\n"
